# Regional streaming: matched RuleGo Streaming/CN categories; also keep Bilibili Intl.
# Source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ConnersHua/RuleGo/master/Surge/Ruleset/Extra/Streaming/CN.list
# Keep common bilivideo.com / hdslb.com CDN on mainland DIRECT; don't proxy entire Bilibili tree.
# The regional selector can be switched to HK/TW; it defaults to DIRECT.
# Bilibili (RuleGo CN streaming)
DOMAIN,api.biliapi.com
DOMAIN,api.biliapi.net
DOMAIN,api.bilibili.com
DOMAIN,app.biliapi.com
DOMAIN,app.biliapi.net
DOMAIN,app.bilibili.com
DOMAIN,grpc.biliapi.net
DOMAIN,m.bilibili.com
DOMAIN,upos-hz-mirrorakam.akamaized.net
DOMAIN,www.bilibili.com
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,cn-hk-eq-bcache-
